# Physics topic codes

Canonical list: `content/topics/physics-topics.json` (from Physics Topics List.xlsx). Use **Symbol** as the tag and **Topic Number** as the syllabus name.

## Foundation (this repo)

- **F01 notes:** F01 Notes-Quantities and Units / F01 筆記-物理量與單位 (`notes.card.quantitiesUnits`)
- **F01 quiz:** F01 Quantities and Units / F01 物理量與單位 (`quiz.label.quantitiesUnits`, `quizzes/foundations-quantities/`)
- **F02 notes:** F02 Notes-Useful Mathematics in Physics / F02 筆記-物理中常用的數學 (`notes.card.usefulMaths`)
- **F02 quiz:** F02 Useful Mathematics in Physics / F02 物理中常用的數學 (`quiz.label.usefulMaths`, `quizzes/foundations-useful-math/`)
- **Foundations hub Quiz tab:** one worksheet. Students choose F01 and F02 under Topics in worksheet settings. Do not add a top F01/F02 picker.

Do not put F01/F02 on flashcard or summary `topic.*` strings unless the teacher asks.

Tracking ids match UniPlus `phy_quiz_attempts`: `phy-jpf01` / `phy-jpf02`. Item `section` is the topic code (`JPF01`, `JPF02`); CH0 has no subtopic codes.
